      ],
      "title": "D-006 — A grant may cover a vault's path in every linked worktree of one clone",
      "description": "Extends D-002: beside the grant keyed by the vault's real path, a maintainer may approve a module's digest for the vault's path in every linked worktree of one repository, keyed by the real path of its git common directory; a matching digest in either scope approves, and no refusal names a command to run.",
